We have to find a way out of here now.

260
00:15:15,420 --> 00:15:16,655
Survival comes first.

261
00:15:16,920 --> 00:15:20,077
If we don't open the door and
escape, these'll be our last words.

262
00:15:20,160 --> 00:15:23,480
I'll stretch my thread to
full extension and call FF.

263
00:15:23,660 --> 00:15:24,940
For now, we back off.

264
00:15:25,160 --> 00:15:27,877
You can collect the discs and
get your sweet revenge later.

265
00:15:27,960 --> 00:15:28,790
I promise.

266
00:15:33,120 --> 00:15:33,950
Hermes?

267
00:15:34,240 --> 00:15:35,380
Right, revenge.

268
00:15:36,000 --> 00:15:37,900
And that's the important part.

269
00:15:38,980 --> 00:15:39,810
Jolene.

270
00:15:40,260 --> 00:15:43,637
And I know it has to be equally
important to Sports Maximum,

271
00:15:43,720 --> 00:15:45,838
who is hiding somewhere around here.

272
00:15:46,280 --> 00:15:49,437
He wants vengeance for my
having drowned him in the pipe.

273
00:15:49,520 --> 00:15:52,917
His mind must have flooded with
thoughts of how to retaliate.

274
00:15:53,000 --> 00:15:55,280
He wants to chew my head to pulp,

275
00:15:55,480 --> 00:15:59,127
then drain the blood spewing
from it until he's sure I'm dead.

276
00:15:59,240 --> 00:16:03,037
What are you - The one who'll eventually
end me is definitely that bastard himself,

277
00:16:03,120 --> 00:16:04,760
with his own foul teeth.

278
00:16:04,940 --> 00:16:05,940
Don't say that!

279
00:16:06,700 --> 00:16:07,877
Listen to me, Jolene.

280
00:16:07,960 --> 00:16:11,997
There's tons of people who'd say getting
revenge won't bring your sister back?

281
00:16:12,080 --> 00:16:14,700
as if they understand
what I'm trying to do.

282
00:16:14,900 --> 00:16:18,076
And others who would tell
me forgiveness is important.

283
00:16:18,900 --> 00:16:19,730
Gloria!

284
00:16:20,640 --> 00:16:21,860
I don't care!

285
00:16:22,340 --> 00:16:24,877
There's no way I'd force myself to forget.

286
00:16:24,960 --> 00:16:28,437
That my own blood relative
was thrown into a sewer?

287
00:16:28,520 --> 00:16:30,940
and just go on about my life.

288
00:16:31,560 --> 00:16:34,400
This is all I've been preparing for.

289
00:16:35,600 --> 00:16:36,718
Revenge is waiting.

290
00:16:37,200 --> 00:16:40,780
So I can decide my own destiny
and finally satisfy it?

291
00:16:41,960 --> 00:16:43,357
Hermes, can you tell me?

292
00:16:43,440 --> 00:16:47,440
This isn't a standoff, right? You
can't! Get back! Don't do this!

293
00:16:47,760 --> 00:16:49,120
I'm calling FF over!

294
00:16:49,620 --> 00:16:51,817
There's five, no wait, seven corpses!

295
00:16:51,900 --> 00:16:54,782
Breaking through the thread
and moving in on you?

296
00:16:55,740 --> 00:16:56,580
Hermes, stop!

297
00:16:56,920 --> 00:16:57,940
Get out of there!

298
00:17:03,100 --> 00:17:04,720
Leave her alone, bitches!

299
00:17:06,400 --> 00:17:07,997
Which way are you coming from?

300
00:17:08,080 --> 00:17:09,280
I'm ready for you!

301
00:17:13,140 --> 00:17:15,200
Shit, I'm fading fast.

302
00:17:22,300 --> 00:17:23,130
Hermes!

303
00:17:24,680 --> 00:17:27,660
She used a sticker to
split her head in two!

304
00:17:28,240 --> 00:17:31,020
Here's my official
license to avenge. Smack!

305
00:17:31,400 --> 00:17:32,600
There you are!

306
00:17:33,020 --> 00:17:34,720
Sports Maximum!

307
00:17:37,560 --> 00:17:39,300
How predictable you are.

308
00:17:39,500 --> 00:17:40,820
I knew you'd do that.

309
00:17:40,960 --> 00:17:44,157
Remember, you did the same thing when
you trapped me in that pipe before.

310
00:17:44,240 --> 00:17:47,457
You used that silly sticker
that splits anything in two.

311
00:17:47,540 --> 00:17:51,900
But you can see, I won't
fall for that power anymore.

312
00:17:53,860 --> 00:17:55,760
Because I, too, am a corpse.

313
00:17:55,880 --> 00:17:56,939
You can't kill me.

314
00:17:58,040 --> 00:17:59,760
Goddamn it. That didn't work.

315
00:18:00,080 --> 00:18:01,717
Where the hell is he hiding?

316
00:18:01,800 --> 00:18:03,040
You're a smart girl.

317
00:18:03,380 --> 00:18:04,321
Follow my voice.

318
00:18:04,660 --> 00:18:05,617
What the hell?

319
00:18:05,700 --> 00:18:06,640
I'll tell you.

320
00:18:06,900 --> 00:18:09,797
It's your sister's fault she
witnessed an average night,

321
00:18:09,880 --> 00:18:12,240
and it cost her everything she had.

322
00:18:14,480 --> 00:18:16,040
Hermes, don't hurt her.

323
00:18:23,500 --> 00:18:24,330
Seriously?

324
00:18:24,413 --> 00:18:25,243
That's not it.

325
00:18:25,360 --> 00:18:27,157
Due to that little incident, now,

326
00:18:27,240 --> 00:18:30,416
after being defeated by you,
this is what I've become.

327
00:18:30,520 --> 00:18:33,520
And unfortunately, my
feelings will never dissolve.

328
00:18:33,780 --> 00:18:35,640
Not this one, for this one!

329
00:18:36,280 --> 00:18:37,260
Listen to me.

330
00:18:37,520 --> 00:18:40,932
Even if I were to suck up your
brain like jelly right now?

331
00:18:41,060 --> 00:18:45,177
and fill that empty skull that's left
with the shit that's in your stomach,

332
00:18:45,260 --> 00:18:49,437
my feelings of hatred towards you will
still exist throughout all of eternity,

333
00:18:49,520 --> 00:18:50,350
you bitch!

334
00:18:53,760 --> 00:18:55,540
It's time to say goodnight!

335
00:18:55,880 --> 00:18:58,060
The one that finishes you off is me!

336
00:19:02,500 --> 00:19:04,500
The moment she's been waiting for.

337
00:19:04,700 --> 00:19:05,860
It's happening now.

338
00:19:06,180 --> 00:19:10,257
The moment he rips off the sticker
and attempts to maul her real head.

339
00:19:10,340 --> 00:19:13,811
If you peel off the sticker,
the two halves will reconjoin.

340
00:19:13,900 --> 00:19:18,057
Even the piece that Sports Maxima bit
off and swallowed will fuse back in.

341
00:19:18,140 --> 00:19:19,277
The jig is up!

342
00:19:19,360 --> 00:19:21,460
I've ID'd your exact location.

343
00:19:21,900 --> 00:19:23,547
I'm aiming right above that.

344
00:19:23,740 --> 00:19:26,640
The median line of your
face, from chin to skull!

345
00:19:35,820 --> 00:19:37,080
She... she did it!

346
00:19:37,360 --> 00:19:38,360
One more thing.

347
00:19:38,620 --> 00:19:41,257
This last parting gift is
for Gloria, you got it?

348
00:19:41,340 --> 00:19:44,437
There must have been a bone in your
ugly face that got crushed before.

349
00:19:44,520 --> 00:19:47,697
And I think the way that happened was
Gloria fought back hard against you.

350
00:19:47,780 --> 00:19:49,297
And this...

351
00:19:49,380 --> 00:19:51,180
is also for Gloria!

352
00:19:52,140 --> 00:19:55,040
Whip that piece of shit
to shreds! Do it now!

353
00:19:58,540 --> 00:20:00,775
What, are you gonna try to hide again?

354
00:20:01,000 --> 00:20:04,917
You can't do that anymore, because I
just put a sticker on your ugly head!

355
00:20:05,000 --> 00:20:06,647
and split that thing in two!

356
00:20:07,640 --> 00:20:10,620
If I peel this, you'll
merge back into one!

357
00:20:11,000 --> 00:20:13,760
This next one is for Gloria too!

358
00:20:16,580 --> 00:20:18,933
Oh yeah, and the one after that as well.

359
00:20:20,720 --> 00:20:23,014
Not to mention the next one after that.

360
00:20:23,160 --> 00:20:24,820
And so on, forever!

361
00:20:25,160 --> 00:20:26,689
They're all for my Gloria!

362
00:20:27,380 --> 00:20:28,260
This one!

363
00:20:29,140 --> 00:20:39,729
And this one!

364
00:20:40,080 --> 00:20:41,900
All for Gloria!

365
00:21:11,440 --> 00:21:12,440
Help, help, that.

366
00:21:12,920 --> 00:21:15,300
Look, I'm finally crying.

367
00:21:16,820 --> 00:21:21,780
All I want right now is to
sob my eyes out by your side.

368
00:21:23,160 --> 00:21:28,580
But I don't have time or even a
speck of energy left to do it.

369
00:21:32,060 --> 00:21:32,890
FF!

370
00:21:32,973 --> 00:21:34,780
I need you! Heal her!

371
00:21:35,460 --> 00:21:36,880
Come on, quickly!

372
00:21:37,600 --> 00:21:39,800
Open this gate for me! Hurry!

373
00:21:51,720 --> 00:21:55,157
Although you think I cope,

374
00:21:55,240 --> 00:22:00,837
my head is filled with hope.

375
00:22:00,920 --> 00:22:05,117
Of some place

376
00:22:05,200 --> 00:22:08,860
other than here?

377
00:22:11,580 --> 00:22:15,300
Although you think I smile!

378
00:22:16,860 --> 00:22:20,360
Inside and all the while

379
00:22:22,120 --> 00:22:28,440
I'm wondering about my destiny.

380
00:22:31,040 --> 00:22:32,957
I'm thinking

381
00:22:33,040 --> 00:22:38,657
about all the

382
00:22:38,740 --> 00:22:43,517
things I'd like

383
00:22:43,600 --> 00:22:49,520
to do in my life.

384
00:22:51,020 --> 00:22:56,817
I'm a dreamer A

385
00:22:56,900 --> 00:22:59,560
distant dreamer

386
00:23:01,400 --> 00:23:03,260
Dreaming far

387
00:23:06,800 --> 00:23:09,600
From today

388
00:23:13,500 --> 00:23:20,040
Abnormality alert activated Code
building 1A Stay right where you are!

389
00:23:20,140 --> 00:23:21,177
Tell us what happened!

390
00:23:21,260 --> 00:23:23,142
Don't move or you'll be a stain!

391
00:23:27,820 --> 00:23:30,920
Inmate number FE40536.

392
00:23:31,320 --> 00:23:33,620
Full name, Jolene Cujo!

393
00:23:38,940 --> 00:23:41,120
After reading that disc, I knew...

394
00:23:41,820 --> 00:23:43,440
what I need to do here.

395
00:23:43,720 --> 00:23:44,600
Right now!

396
00:23:51,340 --> 00:23:52,740
Thank you.

397
00:24:18,120 --> 00:24:19,900
Thank you.
